388 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 227 0 R
/E (The tourist picks a trip type, and the area, dates and group size are filled in for them. Supabase checks their login, and aiProxy reuses a saved answer if there is one. If not, the server checks the daily limit and asks DeepSeek, with a 6-second limit. The reply becomes 3 to 5 place cards, or popular places if anything fails.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
