>>
endobj
391 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 227 0 R
/E (The API key stays on the server and never goes into the app or the repo. Answers come back in under 5 seconds, and the app gives up after 8. Short prompts and a daily limit of 10 requests keep costs low. Only trip details are sent, never names, IC or phone numbers. Every result carries a disclaimer, and we aim for 80% relevance on a 20-trip test set. If anything fails, the app shows popular places with a Retry button.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
